  how: Gaussian elimination mod p, the product of the pivots
> inverse [[1, 2], [3, 4]] mod 7
the 2x2 matrix over GF(7)
  [1 2]
  [3 4]
  det = 5
  inverse:
    [5 1]
    [5 3]
  check: M * M^-1 = I
